#
# The Department of Revenue's Statutory Interest Rates page: the Refunds and
# Deficiency table, whose deficiency column is the annual rate the director
# sets for each calendar year under RSMo 32.065, the rate the addition to tax
# for underpaid estimated tax bears under RSMo 143.761.1. It posts 7% for
# 2026, as the emergency amendment of 12 CSR 10-41.010 sets it, and 7% for
# 2027.

